    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sharon Davidson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101862881933889012428/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLnMeqP2IfMz2UF298J2UL6p0v0W7dlrWy3rGmP2Co7lwsVLE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I checked other roofers prices but I decided to go with Poirer because I witnessed their work on two of my neighbour's roofs and Carl Poirer is kind, he gave me a very fair competitive quote and very kind as he even helped me choose the perfect color of shingles and the job was completed within 2 days, in jet speed, each day his team on time, cleaned up my property perfectly that you would never have known a roof was being replaced. My home looks fabulous! I'm so pleased. Poirer is totally professional in every way, if they did other construction work, I'd hire them for sure. I highly recommend Poirer, 5+ BIG SHINY STARS ******",
        "time": 1731589433,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "jennifer maroufi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104848913934000757741/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzfMKNX_-Undk_s3uT4Udd8ztqi0lXoXp-OS9RDOM6NZEMrvLG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Reliable, punctual, very good communications (always answer calls, are forthcoming with weather delays etc), clean up well after the job is done. They also have very competitive pricing.",
        "time": 1686861895,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kamar Sahloul",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101422170655855101134/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ4maUarVDvNrp3efN2CGupfGvDFIrl3QdheSdd_tQhcD-n1A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Another very satisfied client! Poirier et fils  are so professional, responsive, on time, honest and unbeatable price!  I wish they do another type of construction too we'd love to deal with them again!",
        "time": 1618146582,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Catherine Chandler",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115209689395260374642/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVl-ZOor0dvPvPcz22bx0pv4mJF_ygXwmkO8FdifM9d42zAlYF1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I have only wonderful things to say about Toitures Poirier et Fils Inc. They are true professionals. Quality products, fair pricing, honesty, friendliness. If you live in the Vaudreuil area and even beyond, you would be more than satisfied with this company. Thank you, Richard, Steve, and team!",
        "time": 1566342607,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amélie Hanna",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105129203391896291414/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZfnRxtjbVDkrdgYE_XmcdCTqVIg0xScy6qFjLCPRyAGpdCTE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "13 years ago",
        "text": "These guys were so honest, it was refreshing.  They quoted us a price (which was a bit lower than the other 2 estimates we got) and they stuck to it, despite having found a bunch of hidden problems in our roof.  We were really scared because our roof was in such bad shape, but these guys proved to be trustworthy all the way.  Great guys too!",
